# Scoped exemption — added 2026-08-03, not part of the recovered material.
#
# The repository root .gitignore excludes LaTeX build artifacts (*.log line 82,
# *.aux 89, *.bbl 90, *.blg 91, *.out 92). That is right for a build tree and
# wrong here: this folder is an archive of the April 8 2026 submission, and these
# eight files are the as-submitted state, not artifacts of a build anyone will
# rerun. `codette_paper_v5.bbl` in particular exists nowhere else in the
# repository and holds the *resolved* bibliography as it was submitted — losing
# it means the manuscript cannot be rebuilt as sent.
#
# Without these negations `git add` skips all eight in silence, which is how
# rescued content disappears.

!*.log
!*.aux
!*.bbl
!*.blg
!*.out
